  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `layout/controls.rs` with form-seam helpers (`button`, `small_button`, `list_row`, `radio_value`, `radio_pair`) and exported them through `layout/mod.rs` and `fields.rs`.\n- Added `int_range_row` in `fields.rs` wired to `row_label_id(ui)` (`labelled_by`).\n- Replaced all 5 raw `ui.label` and `ui.button` calls in `holes_page.rs` with `list_row` and `button` (via extracted `axial_hole_rows`).\n- Replaced all 10 raw `ui.label`, `ui.small_button`, `ui.button`, `ui.radio_value`, and `ui.add` calls in `thread_page.rs` with `list_row`, `small_button`, `button`, `radio_pair`, and `int_range_row`.\n- Added `layout/form_seam_tests.rs` to enforce zero raw `ui` widget calls across the `holes` page family and test control behavior.\n- Recorded design choices in `docs/decisions/1122-form-seam-holes.md`.\n- This PR covers the `holes` page family only (one of seven families tracked under #1122).\n\n## Cause\n\n`holes_page.rs` and `thread_page.rs` drew widgets directly with raw `egui::Ui` calls (`ui.label`, `ui.button`, `ui.small_button`, `ui.radio_value`, `ui.add`) instead of routing through the shared form seam.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Pin `egui_app::layout::form_seam_tests::pages_do_not_add_raw_egui_calls_outside_the_form_seam`: failed before the fix (`family 'holes' has 15 raw ui calls (limit 0): holes_page.rs=5, thread_page.rs=10`), passed after the fix.\n- Mutation check on `holes_page.rs`: restoring `upstream/main:crates/ui/src/egui_app/holes_page.rs` failed the pin (`holes_page.rs=5`); restoring the fix passed.\n- Mutation check on `thread_page.rs`: restoring `upstream/main:crates/ui/src/egui_app/thread_page.rs` failed the pin (`thread_page.rs=10`); restoring the fix passed.\n- Behavioral pin `egui_app::layout::form_seam_tests::form_seam_controls_preserve_labels_clicks_and_accessible_names`: passed (`2 passed; 0 failed` in `form_seam_tests`).\n- Existing thread page tests `egui_app::thread_mill_page_tests`: passed (`4 passed; 0 failed`).\n- Quick gate `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed (`ok 14s ui suites, wall 0.3 min, 1 step(s), 0 failed`).\n- Clippy `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed with 0 warnings.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Other page families tracked in #1122 (`2D`, `3D`, `turning`, `multi-axis`, `setup and fixtures`, `tools and machine`).\n- Full interactive visual rendering beyond kittest headless checks.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\n\nChangelog: none\nRefs #1122\n",
